# Clipbin backend configuration (Cloudflare Pages Functions + D1 + R2 + Resend).
#
# The frontend needs NO client-side env vars — it talks to /api/* on the
# same origin. Everything below is server-side, set in the Cloudflare
# dashboard: Pages project "clipbin" → Settings → Environment variables.
#
# Required secrets (Encrypt):
#   RESEND_API_KEY   — Resend API key (sending access) for magic-link emails
#
# Optional plain variables:
#   MAGIC_LINK_FROM  — e.g. "Clipbin <login@hectorchan.com>" (default)
#
# Bindings (Pages → Settings → Functions):
#   D1 database binding, variable name: DB      → database clipbin-db
#   R2 bucket binding,    variable name: IMAGES → bucket clipbin-images
#
# D1 schema: d1/migrations/0001_init.sql (apply via the D1 dashboard console;
# Pages git integration does NOT auto-run migrations).
